<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλ-άσιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλ-ήσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twofold, double,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.68
			</span></i>, etc.: never in Trag. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκρουν</span> is prob. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				152
			</span></i>): freq. as 
				Comp.
			 folld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.10
			</span></i>, etc.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλήσιον ἢ
			ὅσον</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.23
			</span></i>: or c. gen., <i>twice the size of,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.133
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐγίνετο αὐτὸς ἑωυτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.137
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλάσια τῶν ἄλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.238
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῆς ἀληθείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philem.
					160
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλασίοις ἐλάττω</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χρήματα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.52
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλήσιον, τό,</span>
			<i>as much again,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.103
			</span></i>: as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλάσιον σπεύδουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					229
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλασίαν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζημίαν</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, πράττεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					762b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δ. καταδικάζειν</span>
				Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.105
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				645
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἄμεινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.122
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.611
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Eutolm.
			</span></i>).</div>
